    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Numbers",
     "texto": [
      "From 0 to 12 you have to learn them by heart. From 13 to 19 they are formed with the unit number + **zehn**: dreizehn, vierzehn, fünfzehn…",
      "Two lose letters: **sechzehn** (16, without the s of «sechs») and **siebzehn** (17, without the «en» of «sieben»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
