    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Age: with «sein»",
     "texto": [
      "In German you **are** a certain age, just like in English: **Ich bin neunzehn Jahre alt** (literally «I am nineteen years old»). **Ich bin neunzehn** is also fine.",
      "To ask: **Wie alt bist du?** (informal) or **Wie alt sind Sie?** (formal).",
      "Using «haben» for age is a common mistake."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
